wizard agahnim~
Agahnim~
The mighty wizard Agahnim stands here.
~
Agahnim watches you as you enter, and gives a little smirk.  He seems unimpressed by you, as his eyes start to glow a bright blue.  The entire room crackles with his power, and then goes quiet.  Oh, boy.
~
