triforce power piece ninth ganon~
This is Ganon's own, the ninth piece, taken from his great chest. It is one
of nine Triforce pieces, one from each of Hyrule's dungeon guardians: eight
of Wisdom, and Ganon's Power. It is the last; the others open the dungeons,
and this one completes them. With all nine in hand, type COMBINE TRIFORCE
to make the complete Triforce.
~
#0

#ROOMS
#30200
The First Quest Begins~
A small green field lies at the foot of rocky brown hills, quiet and sunny,
the grass trampled into a faint path. In the cliff to the north a dark cave
mouth opens, and from within flickers the warm glow of twin fires. Someone
has scratched a few plain words into the rock beside it: IT'S DANGEROUS TO
GO ALONE. Paths lead north, east and west into the wider world.
