#30215
Southeast Coast~
The land ends at a rocky shore in the far southeastern corner of Hyrule,
where grey waves crash and white spray drifts on the wind. Tide pools
glimmer among the tumbled rocks, and blue-grey stones lie flung far up the
beach where no wave could have thrown them. It is the very end of the world
in two directions. Paths lead north along the coast and west inland.
