outcrop of brown rock. A cave mouth in its side flickers with a soft yellow
glow, and the warm smell of melted wax hangs about the entrance, where a
merchant trades in light against the dark places of the world. Pebbles lie
scattered over the slope as if hurled from somewhere. Paths lead east, west
and south.
