#30249
Hollow of Headstones~
A sunken hollow of cracked gravestones sits under a sky that never quite
seems to brighten. Crows' feathers and old wilted flowers litter the bare
earth between the graves, and the air smells of damp soil. The mist here
gathers itself into shapes that drift between the stones, and touching a
grave seems to wake them. The burial ground climbs north, while a worn path
slips out west.
