#30251
Fairy Pond of the Woods~
The forest opens onto a bright, clear pool fed by a quiet spring, its banks
soft with moss and tiny white flowers. Motes of light drift and spin over
the water like fairies at play, and the air feels warm and restful, as if
every wound and weariness drains away into it. A narrow track leads back
south into the trees.
