#30253
Isle of the Snake~
A small green island rises out of the lake, ringed on every side by cold,
lapping water. At its heart a dark stone entrance is carved in the coiled
shape of a serpent, its doorway breathing out damp air. Across a gap of
water to the south lies the lakeshore, too wide to jump; only those who
came over on a raft or bridged it with a ladder ever set foot on its grass.
