Wooded Crossroads~
Four forest paths meet in a small trampled clearing ringed by stout trees.
Broken spearheads and torn bits of blue hide lie in the leaf litter. A
single bush at the clearing's edge has dried out completely, its twigs as
brittle as kindling, and through them the glint of a polished shield seems
to catch the light from somewhere below. Ways lead off in every direction.
