Armos Sentinel Grove~
Stone knight statues stand in silent rows among the trees, shields raised
and faces worn smooth by the years. They seem to watch the path, and one
stands slightly out of line with the others, the moss on its base torn as
if it had stepped down and back again. Touching any of them feels like a
dare. The grove is a dead end, and the only way out leads back west.
