Ghost Hill~
A low grassy hill overlooks the graveyard to the west, its slopes dotted
with wildflowers and scarred by heavy hoofprints and black scorch marks
where something breathes fire. A flower head spins up from the grass now
and then and whirls away. The air is warmer than among the graves. A
crevice to the north needs a ladder to cross, and the way continues east
and west.
