The Quiet Glade~
Tall trees ring a peaceful glade of soft grass, and the light falls in
gentle patches through their leaves. Birdsong drifts from the branches, and
no tracks but a deer's cross the turf. A narrow gully leads north toward
the higher country, too deep to climb without a ladder, and the glade opens
to the east.
