The Eagle's Gate~
On a spit of green land cut off by the river, a stone entrance stands in a
rocky outcrop, its lintel carved with the spread wings of an eagle and
walled about by green-grey statues. Cool, musty air drifts from the
darkness within, smelling of bats. The river runs wide to the east, where a
wooden dock waits for anyone with a raft to cross back.
