The Fairy Fountain, North~
A clear pool lies in a ring of soft grass and white stones, its surface
glittering with tiny motes of light that flit and circle like fairies at
play. The water is perfectly still and smells of rain and flowers, and a
warmth rises from it that eases every ache and closes every wound. A path
leads away to the south.
