#30292
Lake Hylia, North Cliffs~
Brown cliffs rise from the northern edge of Lake Hylia, and the blue water
glints below. The rock is dented by paired springing marks, and one part of
the cliff face is split with deep cracks, a cool draught breathing through
them and a faint red glow pulsing behind, as though a bomb would open a
