Level 6: Ember Hall~
Glowing embers lie scattered in the cracks of this hall as though fire had
rained from nowhere, flung by sorcerers who vanish and reappear between one
breath and the next. The walls are scorched red-black in broad splashes,
and the air is hot and dry. A shutter guards the north, and open ways lead
east and west.
