Level 6: Gohma's Nest~
Shed carapace fragments and deep scuttle marks crisscross the floor of this
lair, and the walls are gouged by great pincers. Broken arrows lie thick
near the north wall, nearly all snapped against a hard shell. Above it all
a single huge eye is carved, staring. A locked door lies south, and the
door north is locked with the guardian's key.
