Both the east and west walls of this hall are crazed with cracks around
thin, poorly set patches of brick that a bomb would open. A sticky residue
glistens across the floor beside bent shield rivets, and sparks crackle
along the wall seams. A heavy shutter leads south, back toward the ember-
strewn hall.
