Level 6: Hall of Twin Fires~
Two fires burn in dragon-shaped braziers at the far end of this quiet room,
and the stone between them is worn smooth by long vigil. Words are carved
above the flames, the letters deep and sure: AIM AT THE EYES OF GOHMA. An
arrow is cut beneath them. A shutter leads south, and the west wall is
cracked and weak.
