Level 7: Hall of Shed Skins~
Pale, papery snakeskins lie curled in the corners of this low chamber, and
thin sinuous tracks wind through the grit, snapping into straight furrows
wherever they line up with the door. The walls are cold and close, and a
faint hiss lingers in the air long after any sound has stopped. The only
way out is the open doorway to the north.
