Level 7: Demon's Gate~
Damp stone steps come down from the drained pond above into a vestibule of
green-black brick carved with a horned, grinning face. Water still beads on
the walls and gathers in the seams between the floor tiles, and the air
smells of silt and old reeds. The pond waits overhead for the tune that
sent it away. Open archways lead north and east into the dark.
