A bare square chamber whose blue-green flagstones are slick with seep from
the pond overhead. The only sound is a slow, patient dripping that echoes
from every wall, and green weed hangs from the ceiling where the water once
stood. An open archway leads west toward the entry stair, and another opens
north into deeper halls.
