Level 7: Moat Crossroads~
A channel of black water rings a raised island of flagstones at the heart
of this room, its surface still and cold, and boomerang splinters float on
it. Narrow stone lips along the walls let a traveller skirt the moat to
reach the open doorways east and south. Both the north and west walls are
fractured and hollow-looking, as if a bomb would bring them down.
