Level 7: Urchin's Hollow~
Coarse sand has drifted across the floor of this chamber, and great round
depressions are pressed into it as though a vast spiked ball had rolled
from wall to wall. Broken spines as long as a forearm lie scattered among
the dunes. The room is unnaturally quiet; even footsteps seem swallowed,
though a shrill note would ring for a long time. Open arches lead east and
west.
