Level 7: Bone-Strewn Alcove~
The far eastern end of the dungeon gathers into a cramped alcove littered
with skulls, ribs and rusted sword hilts. Some of the bones look disturbed,
shuffled into heaps that were not there before and arranged as if they
meant to stand up. The stale air carries a dry rattle, and the only way out
is the open arch to the west.
