Huge three-toed prints are pressed into the soot that coats this chamber,
and the walls are scorched black in broad arcs where swallowed bombs went
off inside something thick-hided. A reptilian musk hangs in the air with a
whiff of brimstone. A sturdy locked door with an iron keyhole stands in the
north wall; open doorways lead east and south.
