Level 7: The Old Man's Fires~
Two fires burn in stone braziers at the far end of this bare room, and
their light dances across plain walls and a floor worn smooth where someone
has long stood. A riddle is cut into the stone between them: THERE'S A
SECRET IN THE TIP OF THE NOSE. Below it, faint lines sketch a horned face
whose nose points south. A heavy shutter seals the south doorway.
