Level 7: Hall of Grumbling~
Gnawed bones and an empty clay bowl lie before the north doorway, and a
deep, hungry grumble rises from the stones. GRUMBLE, GRUMBLE... is
scratched over and over on the door frame in a clumsy, clawed hand. Whoever
keeps this passage is plainly starving and will let no one by on an empty
stomach; a little bait might help. A heavy shutter seals the north, and a
locked door stands south.
