Level 9: Gel-Choked Crossway~
Tiny quivering blobs of jelly cling to the walls and floor of this
crossing, leaving a slick, sour-smelling film everywhere and sticking to
the boots of anyone who passes. Locked doors with keyholes stand in the
north, south and west walls, and a cracked section of the east wall looks
weak.
