Level 9: Winged Watchtower~
The ceiling here rises into a tall, dark shaft, and claw marks streak its
upper walls where heavy blue wings have gripped the stone and horned shapes
have dropped on intruders. A cold draught spills down from above. Open
archways lead north and south, and the west wall bears a thin crack.
