Level 9: Ooze-Streaked Passage~
Streaks of slime run down the walls of this narrow chamber, a few shield
rivets lie in a sticky puddle, and a cold, uneasy feeling lingers in the
air. Rows of dark blocks line the floor. A locked door leads east, while
the north and south walls both show cracked, weakened stone.
