Level 9: Hall of Quivering Gel~
Little blobs of jelly quiver on every flagstone, leaving sticky trails
behind them and hopping in short bursts toward any warmth. The room smells
sour and damp. An open archway leads north, locked doors stand to the south
and west, and a cracked patch scars the east wall.
