Level 9: Sealed Western Sanctum~
Scorch marks and a strange chill fill this isolated corner room, and the
floor is laid with a careful arrangement of stone blocks. One block in the
middle of the east side sits slightly out of line with the rest, its base
scraped clean, and a silver gleam seems to show in the crack beneath. The
only exit is a cracked section of the south wall.
