Level 9: Sand Burrow Hall~
Coarse grey sand fills this hall, heaped into ridges and churned by long
winding furrows where a segmented, many-legged thing races beneath the
surface. A dry, earthy smell rises from the disturbed ground. Shutters
stand at the north and south ends, and here and there the sand has
collapsed into hollows.
