Level 9: Silent Cell~
A small, quiet chamber with a strange chill in the air that gathers and
drifts without any wind, the cold trail of a bouncing skull. The floor is
bare and the walls plain basalt. Locked doors with keyholes lead south and
west, and there is no other way out.
