Level 9: Stair of the Devourers~
Sticky residue coats the floor around a stair that drops into a tunnel
running deep beneath the dungeon, and scraps of chewed leather and bent
shield rims lie in heaps along the walls. Whatever lives here swallows
first and spits out later. An open archway leads south, and a locked door
with a keyhole guards the east.
