Pale bluish scorch marks streak the walls in straight lines, crossing and
recrossing one another where blue-robed sorcerers have stepped through the
stone and cast. The air carries the sharp smell of spent magic. An open
doorway leads east, a locked door west, and the south wall shows a web of
cracks.
