Level 9: Sage of the Northern Hall~
Twin fires burn on either side of a worn spot on the floor in this quiet
chamber, casting long, wavering shadows across the bare stone. A blunt
sentence is scratched into the wall between them: PATRA HAS THE MAP. Beside
it someone has drawn an eye ringed by smaller eyes. A shutter leads south
and a locked door west.
