Level 9: Silver Arrow Cellar~
A ladder leads up from this narrow, side-cut basement, its walls of dark
brick stacked in even rows. A hush hangs over the place, broken only by the
drip of water somewhere in the dark, and a cold silver light seems to
gather at the far end, the colour of the only thing that can finish the
dark lord. The floor runs level to a raised ledge.
