Level 9: Red Ring Cellar~
A narrow basement hollowed from the mountain's rock, reached by a ladder
that rises toward the chamber above. The brick walls are warm to the touch,
and a faint red glow lingers in the dust like the light through a ruby, a
warmth that seems to promise blows will land softer. A raised ledge stands
at the far end of the level floor.
