#30650
The Old Man's Cave~
A low cave opens into the hillside, its walls black with the soot of two
fires that never burn down. Scratched into the rock above the fires, in a
careful old hand: IT'S DANGEROUS TO GO ALONE! TAKE THIS. Beneath it,
smaller: NINE GUARDIANS, IN ORDER. EACH KEEPS A KEY; EACH KEY A CHEST; EACH
CHEST A PIECE OF THE TRIFORCE AND WHAT THE NEXT DUNGEON ASKS OF YOU.
