#30652
Beneath the Hero's Grave~
A narrow stair beneath the old headstone ends in a cold, close vault. Twin
fires burn on either side of a worn stone plinth, empty, its surface scored
where a long blade once lay. Words are cut deep into its edge: THE THIEF OF
POWER TOOK WHAT SLEPT HERE. SEEK IT IN HIS LAIR. The air smells of earth
and iron, and the silence has the weight of a promise left unkept.
~
