#30653
The Hermit's Cave~
This cave sits high in the northeastern rocks where few travellers think to
look. Two small fires warm a dry floor, and a writing desk has been made
from a flat slab of stone, its inkpot dry and a ribbon of royal blue wax
beside it. Chalked on the wall in a neat hand is a single instruction: SHOW
THIS TO THE OLD WOMAN. Whoever lives here keeps the place tidy and keeps to
the old courtesies.
~
