#30654
A Hidden Heart Grotto~
Rubble from the shattered wall lies across the mouth of this little grotto.
Beyond it the cave is dry and quiet, lit by two steady fires set into the
floor, and the air is warm in a way that feels like a hand on the shoulder.
A ledge between the fires glows faintly red, a gift kept for anyone
determined enough to blast their way in.
