#30655
A Grotto in the Mountain~
The blast that opened this cave left its walls raw and sharp, and dust
still hangs in the firelight. The chamber beyond is small and surprisingly
warm, sheltered from the wind and the falling rock that scour the mountain
outside. A faint red pulse of light comes from the far end, steady as a
heartbeat, and the two fires lean toward it.
~
