#30656
Beneath the Burned Bush~
Ash from the burned bush has drifted down the steps into this hollow under
the roots. Two fires burn here already, older than the one that opened the
way, and the earthen walls are hung with pale threads of root. A warm red
glow lingers between the flames. The place feels like a secret the forest
kept for itself until a candle asked for it.
