#30657
The Raft Island~
A spit of sand and rock stands alone in open water, reachable only by raft
from the dock on the shore. Waves lap at every side, and a single scrubby
tree leans over a sheltered hollow in the middle where a soft red glow
beats like a heart. It is the kind of place a reward would be hidden:
obvious from the shore and impossible to reach without the means.
~
