#30659
Hollow of the Old Tree~
The burned bush opened onto a hollow beneath the roots of an enormous old
tree. The walls are packed earth and root, and the light here is strange:
it flickers in square, coloured blocks and seems to come from somewhere
other than Hyrule. A soft electric hum fills the hollow, and the air
carries a faint smell of dust, coins and arcade lights, as though a way
home lay close by.
