#30660
It's a Secret to Everybody~
The burned bush revealed a short stair down into a cosy earthen cave. Two
fires crackle in the gloom, and the floor between them is scuffed by heavy,
clawed feet and the butt of a resting spear. Whoever lives here is generous
with strangers, provided the strangers keep quiet about where they found
the money; it is, after all, a secret to everybody.
~
