#30661
It's a Secret to Everybody~
Broken stone from the bombed wall lies just inside this cramped cave. Two
fires burn in the dark, and their light catches a few loose glints of green
and blue on the floor. The place has the cheerful untidiness of someone who
hides coin for a living, expects to be found now and then, and asks only
that nobody tell.
