It's a Secret to Everybody~
This cave sits in plain sight at the far northeast of the land, which may
be why nobody bothers to look in it. Two fires burn on either side of the
floor, warming a chamber that smells of wind and stone. The secret of the
place is not where it is, but how generously it gives away its coin to
whoever walks in.
