#30674
Under the Armos Statue~
The statue that guarded this spot has been moved, and beneath it lies a
shallow stone alcove cut square into the bedrock. Its walls bear faded
carvings of a hand gripping a mountain and lifting it, and of great stones
rolled aside. The space is just large enough to kneel in, and it was
clearly made to keep one small thing safe for whoever dared touch the
sentinel above.
