#30690
A Hidden Merchant's Cave~
This cave was hidden behind rock or root, and the merchant who trades here
prefers it that way. Two fires burn in the dim, and a short row of goods
sits on a woven mat with prices painted beneath them in rupees. The finer
wares cost dearly; BOY, THIS IS REALLY EXPENSIVE! is chalked on the wall,
as if in sympathy. Finding the place is part of the price.
