#30692
The Medicine Woman's Cave~
Bundles of dried herbs hang from the ceiling of this warm cave, and two
fires keep the damp off a row of stoppered bottles, some red and some blue.
The air smells of bitter roots and sweet syrup. A sign reads BUY MEDICINE
BEFORE YOU GO, but nothing is sold to strangers: the old woman who keeps
the shop wants a letter proving the royal family sent you.
~
