#30710
A Money-Making Game~
Three overturned markers lie on the floor of this cave, each hiding a sum
painted on its underside, some won and some lost. Two fires throw their
light across them evenly, so nothing gives away which is which. Chalked
above them: LET'S PLAY MONEY MAKING GAME. The game is honest, in its way:
anybody can play, and anybody can lose.
~
